    "headline": "A 2-gallon tank is enough",
    "explain": "Heating 50 gallons from 40 °F to 120 °F adds about 0.50 gal of water. With 60 psi supply and a 150 psi maximum, the tank needs 0.92 gal of total volume. Choose a 2-gallon tank and set its precharge to 60 psi.",
